        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨<strong>Turn your desktop into a living world of adventure!</strong>✨</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your new digital companion who will live right on your desktop! Your pet is not just an animation, but a full-fledged character with its own needs and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾<strong>Drag your pet across the screen:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick up your pet with the mouse and drag it anywhere on the screen. It will walk across the Start menu, explore the desktop, and slide down the edges of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/461142f33eaeba67b81f40ef05bc5d78.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/461142f33eaeba67b81f40ef05bc5d78.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱<strong>Grow food:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pet can plant, water, and harvest crops. All you need is to place a plot for planting and throw in a seed, after which your pet will plant and harvest everything on its own. Watering plants only works if there is water in the inventory, which must be collected in advance from the well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/74cdb5f09591ccca14b5d31cfb1664f3.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/74cdb5f09591ccca14b5d31cfb1664f3.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛏️<strong>Mine resources:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet can mine various resources in special mines. You can sell these resources in the market for coins or, with the right equipment, process them, create different tools and materials, and sell them for even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/7d5c63b7f103806f7572878857a69a1b.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/7d5c63b7f103806f7572878857a69a1b.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰<strong>Trade:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell all the vegetables you grow and resources you mine in the market for money, which you will need to buy crafting machines, seeds, gifts, and more. You can also make deals with merchants in exchange for certain resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/33a5cd3beb356c4e241d2780aad11ac1.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/33a5cd3beb356c4e241d2780aad11ac1.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💖<strong>Take care of your pet:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pet has needs such as hunger, thirst, fatigue, and mood. Monitor all needs to keep your pet happy. With a bad mood or low level of any need, it will refuse to work. If you neglect your pet, it will leave you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/4dd814d4166593e64763afcc51b5095c.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/4dd814d4166593e64763afcc51b5095c.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📦<strong>Resource management:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will encounter many different resources and crafting. All items on the desktop can be moved and rearranged using the mouse. Your pet can also help you with this, clearing the desktop of unnecessary resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/ea4dd2960a82955724d61a089ab8b766.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/ea4dd2960a82955724d61a089ab8b766.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏰<strong>Built-in timer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To increase the multifunctionality of the game, a clock with a timer was added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set a timer for up to 60 hours. And you don’t need to keep it on the desktop. Just set it and hide it in the inventory. If the timer expires while it’s on the desktop, it will start ringing; if it’s in the inventory, your pet will take it out and notify you that the time is up. Measure time for work, rest, or play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/533c58e628ddcf4b9b4fb1d5faedc021.poster.avif?t=1768561875\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995000/extras/533c58e628ddcf4b9b4fb1d5faedc021.webm?t=1768561875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔧<strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on top of all applications</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic progress saving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not interfere with regular computer work</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawoki: Desktop Pets is the perfect way to add a little joy and life to your workday. Your digital friend is always nearby, ready to cheer you up and keep you company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and start an amazing journey with your new pet!</p>",
